  "description": "Full SEO and site audit for Umbraco (16, 17, 18). Crawls every Content & Media URL (plus sitemap.xml), checks for broken links, images and resources, and audits each page for SEO (title, meta, canonical, headings, noindex/nofollow), Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO (HTTPS, gzip, caching, schema.org), content quality (readability, thin/duplicate content), a static accessibility subset and carbon emissions. Produces a health score, grouped issues with priority, orphaned-page detection, incremental scans, CSV export and a per-page detail view — all in the backoffice. Also includes the original \"fetch as Googlebot/Bingbot\" URL Viewer tool with full redirect chain, headers, HTML source, cloaking and spam/hack detection. Runs as a recurring background job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor). Server-side and SSRF-safe. (Formerly \"uTPro URL Viewer\".)",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
